zufft bundles the FFT component of ducc0 ("Distinctly Useful Code
Collection"), https://gitlab.mpcdf.mpg.de/mtr/ducc, in src/ducc0/.

The bundled files are exactly the subset SciPy vendors in
subprojects/duccfft: the files of ducc0 whose SPDX line reads
"BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-or-later". zufft elects the BSD-3-Clause licence
for them. The rest of ducc0 is GPL-2.0-or-later only and is not included.
tools/vendor/manifest.tsv records the ducc0 and SciPy commits, and
tools/vendor/checksums.sha256 the SHA-256 of every bundled file, in the
package's source repository.

