src/ducc0/infra/threading.cc, two helper templates (a y-combinator) inside
a block that is compiled only when DUCC0_HIERARCHICAL_SUBMISSION is
defined, which zufft never does:

  Copyright 2015 The TensorFlow Authors.

The functions prev_good_size_cmplx() and prev_good_size_real() in
src/zff_lengths.cpp are ported from SciPy's
scipy/fft/_duccfft/pyduccfft.cxx, part of SciPy's duccfft, which is
licensed under the 3-clause BSD licence below ("Licensed under a 3-clause
BSD style license - see LICENSE.md"). Copyright SciPy Developers.

